 A very odd piece of tit for tat; too nearly divides approached from caricature, & in revenge caricature divides to be reckoned from too nearly; put sheer caricature next to approached. /
===
 A very odd piece of tit for tat; *too nearly* divides *approached* from *caricature,* & in revenge *caricature* divides *to be reckoned* from *too nearly*; put *sheer caricature* next to *approached.*/
>>>

